Alembic migrations for networking-srv6-agent.

Driven by neutron-db-manage, which resolves the entry point

    neutron.db.alembic_migrations =
        networking-srv6-agent = networking_srv6_agent.db.migration:alembic_migrations

by STRING-SPLITTING it into a directory path (neutron/db/migration/cli.py,
_get_root_versions_dir) -- it is never imported. The module:attr form is a
path convention here, not an attribute lookup.

    neutron-db-manage --subproject networking-srv6-agent upgrade heads

The whole schema is created by one expand revision. This is a new project,
not a migration of the networking-bgpvpn tables: the table and column names
differ, and nothing upgrades from those.
